  "deletedAt": null,
  "details": "The player voice sometimes is not coming out from the avatar's mouth, most often the voice will be above the player.\nResetting the avatar (AV3 menu > Expressions > Reset avatar) fixes the issue.\nI have witnessed this happening to someone else for the first time on the 5th of May on Live.\nSeveral friends of mine appear to recall this happening to themselves and others for at least 2 weeks, so this predates UnU.",
